+| 93420.48007025628 | 3.5391356579032634e-6 | 1.565760e-14 |
+| 149472.76811241003 | 2.1894811648609800e-6 | 5.789518e-16 |
+| 298945.53622482007 | 1.0855589761340900e-6 | 1.175984e-17 |
