+## First unexecuted native action, with its consumer
+
+The first unavailable *contracted* action is
+
+\[
+ \mathcal R_{\rm ind}(v,j)
+ =\delta_v\delta_j\Gamma_{\rm AE4}[0]
+  -H_{\rm local,already\ owned}(v,j)
